#: scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1c3b72a677ae20fea933c70e1e73da5060cb4eadc949d3e69b4f2f463237e6b
#. default-sha256: 22a3e41565d5fe6134857fc7b08f3c8475beb9314917a68aa7b53d235c8d35a0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫This is something that actually happened to another maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫È⟪k:7⟫ una storia capitata ad un’altra domestica."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7377c0266b5742c77020d72cea3182712820b95731a7a8b72e1c9fc2b6d21c4c
#. default-sha256: 24f806765b4dae227564da9b32d04388cfdb76913b139a5022a5fed43927a10f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She heard a sound in the middle of the night.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A sound like dripping water."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva sentito un suono nel cuore della notte.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Un suono come l’acqua che gocciola."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f0e650fb530a48c491b07b1f0fe8635e30e8eb7656cbe0c6feda5c6823748e7
#. default-sha256: c2b54ca4fab03d99f0c150ebaf690dd9319516f606494aa810c702b9766e42e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At first, ⟪k:3⟫she thought it was raining, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫so she looked through the "
"window, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and there wasn’t a cloud in the sky to cover the stars."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Inizialmente, ⟪k:3⟫aveva pensato che stesse piovendo, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫così aveva "
"guardato attraverso la finestra, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫e non c’era una nuvola a coprire le stelle nel cielo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3a5e45ab416d8cd53822df01d9873b6d0e3c04828e3b0ffdd3f4d61c76c6518
#. default-sha256: b08491d8f98f9cb69a3ba1f15f00c60a0c0d18097ca7d2e9c531f4dc1ad60b4e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Maybe it’s a faucet,” ⟪k:1⟫she thought, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫so she stepped out of her room and into "
"the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Forse è un rubinetto”, ⟪k:1⟫aveva pensato, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫perciò uscì fuori dalla sua camera, "
"raggiungendo il corridoio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c484246b4e618382b27fe15f10ef015b8555777c85e4b2c197d6a99525f52638
#. default-sha256: f16216590599769c4ad0882a28e496e89f4c6755e1d337261c18c921c97997e3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Compared to her room, ⟪k:1⟫it was unearthly chilly.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The maid regretted not bringing "
"something to cover herself with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rispetto alla sua stanza, ⟪k:1⟫l’aria era inspiegabilmente fredda.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La domestica si "
"pentì di non aver portato qualcosa per coprirsi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0929d239efeeab3cd20626f35656b39f8e1bd615414d6c4953df70652e3affff
#. default-sha256: cabef63fcad5e93df7fd2bbca14decf72f0545ab7d88ac31102c321298f673fa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that didn’t make any sense.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Normally, ⟪k:3⟫the temperature wasn’t that much "
"colder outside her room. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Her nightclothes had always been more than enough for a trip "
"to the lavatory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non aveva senso.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Di norma, ⟪k:3⟫la temperatura lì non era così gelida. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"La sua camicia da notte era sempre stata più che sufficiente per andare al bagno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8999139a314bc058956af20f273424fcb0d1119e182c57b0e2ddecef440607bc
#. default-sha256: 0a3b4a411f7c38cdd9133ccf957af6b4eb9c49310ff1240c70abe54d9e19de89
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wondering what the reason could be,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she made her way toward the sound—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but then, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫she realized something:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Chiedendosi quale potesse essere la ragione,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫si fece strada in direzione del suono—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ma poi, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫si rese conto di una cosa:"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66871857d37b0bc47fce3e988034929e7d66f9ecbec67aa0354e7d3140062440
#. default-sha256: 7fd8a61a3caa0e9178f3442b79bebe5c0a3ffd69cbe3461c2bb7f1f402d8ff96
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were no faucets in the direction she was going.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Rather, ⟪k:4⟫she was "
"headed toward a hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫non c’erano rubinetti nella direzione in cui stava andando.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Anzi, ⟪k:4⟫era "
"diretta verso un salone."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6d502d050692a7a9c5d9c3d4d6d0012af93a43adf170b45a297cc9d73406b1d
#. default-sha256: 907981ed06d79108cb25eed24f6b2b3422c52d3b229bf0769cdac07bd7e69cc3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion where she served had many halls,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but this one was off in a far "
"corner of the house—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫the least used hall of them all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La villa dove lavorava aveva molte sale,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ma quella si trovava in un angolo "
"remoto della casa—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫la sala meno utilizzata di tutte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9266cd04a3f0c6fd92360d2fedb2bb5ef7eeece97b5631857a0fc8efac18c9e
#. default-sha256: ba4f156dd7f1d4428035cea3b2097821a2d944d3a0f943ac3e2796d56a2d0232
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It had a high roof, ⟪k:3⟫but not a lot of space, ⟪k:4⟫so it was difficult to make "
"good use of. ⟪k:5⟫It also had a somewhat heavy air to it—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫a very curious room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aveva un tetto alto, ⟪k:3⟫ma non aveva molto spazio, ⟪k:4⟫quindi era difficile "
"farne buon uso. ⟪k:5⟫C’era un’aria alquanto pesante—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫era una stanza davvero curiosa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 140df8dbbdf7113d35bb2211cebe6b191f6199c949aed64f109980d0f1fdd864
#. default-sha256: 4bbc1d6b2cc9dd7e3a84cd61e1a687a6c9ce46fe3952ddf487f7915566ae71b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was the kind of place you might assign someone to clean as part of their hazing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era il tipo di posto che faresti pulire a qualcuno come parte della sua preparazione al "
"lavoro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb5aaad08695fbea61ee0ede6259deeda7900c2888c60e8af4f890f8b41e1ae6
#. default-sha256: 11e58fe633fe9ff4e5abec7bcf1265619c9df6f2a9d50363aca3b6fc3252b126
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anyway, ⟪k:1⟫when the maid realized the sound was coming from that particular hall, ⟪k:2⟫"
"she, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as you might expect, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫let out an uncomfortable sigh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ad ogni modo, ⟪k:1⟫quando la domestica capì che il suono proveniva da quell’insolita stanza, "
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫com’era normale che fosse, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫emise un sospiro colmo di disagio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 789c0ff402d86628b1e367989f9f84431ce88df97ec065a8d955d8d041389579
#. default-sha256: c3fbf8a0a27596867a92ce85ee9039de5bb091ca6b28e04a370133d759383142
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there might be a leak, ⟪k:1⟫and having noticed, ⟪k:2⟫she couldn’t simply ignore it, ⟪k:3⟫"
"you know?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma poteva esserci una perdita, ⟪k:1⟫e avendolo notato, ⟪k:2⟫non poteva semplicemente "
"ignorarlo, ⟪k:3⟫no?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d74f4d096afa3ad58d2439a7881412c700018bfd7de258038938e3bd30a9cc3
#. default-sha256: d2a0a220e4470a2709f1fce0d518009b428983a42f21f42aad3cb071711ebf9c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as much as she hesitated, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she pushed open the doors to the hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫per quanto esitasse, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫aprì le porte della sala."

#: scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 240c6eeb477b34cf5e4ccf03ad4577e001b15b1846f42dfb778523abaeef9a71
#. default-sha256: 809f5f91beb3b00a4928859b62be89c759f19909907f82f224caa68a3627bb17
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was nobody there, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and it didn’t look like anything was leaking, "
"⟪k:5⟫either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non c’era nessuno lì,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ né tantomeno sembrava esserci una perdita."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8e1291a5f7331523eed43f5f8d14c7fb3c50b848c9ae6263053374a6e17ab24
#. default-sha256: 7732378782281a05e677e77264d6866d0afc7359e83a31d05d1bb073cd712925
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There were no puddles ⟪k:1⟫or water stains ⟪k:2⟫anywhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non c’erano pozze, né macchie d’acqua."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8e7cf2b98d5becdfd0830597714581a8b2fd95025cbf95c1ac2730f9521245c
#. default-sha256: 8230a043307a03e2c8df210d8d527ff523f4a39aeed278c8e92d0c8905289184
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But she could still hear the sound, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫drip, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫drip⟪k:8⟫, ⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫getting louder and louder."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma poteva ancora udire quel suono, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫plic, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫plic⟪k:8⟫, ⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫che diventava sempre più forte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59b5f74badce09c619846e7d4483a239d1e346fa2160606679007873e42f4f0c
#. default-sha256: 4ea19be00dc5a6aa4c3c69dc4d365d43c33ce5149778e9ce8fc5efe5b9f87031
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Slowly stepping further into the room, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫looking left, ⟪k:3⟫then right, ⟪k:4⟫then "
"left again, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she searched for the source of the sound, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫coming to a stop "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avanzando lentamente nella stanza, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫guardò a sinistra, ⟪k:3⟫poi a destra,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"poi di nuovo a sinistra, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫cercando la fonte del suono, ⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫per poi "
"fermarsi⟪k:11⟫al centro della sala."

#: scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04b9984f33b52d6a8b5c346f0530a96b9bbe43c8f09e323121be7ba55a314bf5
#. default-sha256: 6251ee773ef27e6a8efdc6354bd36b8fbad52e0db32b63f59955255e77e655ff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She stood there still, ⟪k:1⟫quiet, ⟪k:2⟫and then—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a chilly spot on the nape of her "
"neck."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rimase ferma lì, ⟪k:1⟫in silenzio, ⟪k:2⟫e poi—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫sentì qualcosa di gelido sulla nuca."

#: scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc3fb62bb93819e27168a2bee358f743fd218ffe015db3022649ca4630476f16
#. default-sha256: 45464e812adddb95df9fd3efaf227b578feed25273397e265768b1eb39cb6fbb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a little yelp, ⟪k:1⟫she reached back to feel her neck, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but it wasn’t wet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Trasalì, ⟪k:1⟫e poi allungò la mano per toccarsi il collo,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ma non era bagnato."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92cfdfc10dd2ead1ad8092a2fd9be02d4278c1a2130fd2dbe7bfda443a3959dd
#. default-sha256: 395546b200b5dc2d22430483a675b20280861d39975d56f19db7f838b54257cb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Confused, ⟪k:1⟫she slowly, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫warily tilted her head backward..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Confusa, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫inclinò lentamente la testa all’indietro..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E1B1B5B_DE17_4A4D_A3AE_D65844474192
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47c8383c6ece4a902ef0175ff9e72a4784eb75a7f24c0a19a80e8f7f79359e73
#. default-sha256: d5ed731c1f90908c8def74fb81daeba0e8e2ae44e94fff7dbc2a3a449fe094fd
